-- =============================================================================
-- OpenDive Atlas — starter dive sites
--
-- Well-known dive sites published as *unverified* starter entries so divers can
-- begin logging sightings, ratings and photos and suggest corrections.
-- Coordinates are approximate and conditions are typical ranges only.
-- Idempotent: existing slugs are left untouched.
-- Generated from curated data; 211 sites.
-- =============================================================================

