  ('1000-steps', '1000 Steps', 'Bonaire', 'Bonaire — West Coast', 12.2178, -68.3325, '{shore,reef,wall}', 'beginner', 20, 35, 26, 29, 30, 'mild', 'A famous shore dive reached by a limestone staircase (closer to 70 steps). The reef slopes to a wall with hard corals, turtles and occasional eagle rays.', false),
  ('karpata', 'Karpata', 'Bonaire', 'Bonaire — Washington Slagbaai area', 12.2196, -68.3519, '{shore,reef,wall}', 'intermediate', 20, 35, 26, 29, 35, 'mild', 'A steep reef slope with dense elkhorn coral in the shallows and gorgonians down the wall. Old anchors from the plantation era lie on the slope.', false),
  ('oil-slick-leap', 'Oil Slick Leap', 'Bonaire', 'Bonaire — West Coast', 12.2055, -68.3093, '{shore,reef,wall}', 'intermediate', 20, 35, 26, 29, 30, 'mild', 'A giant-stride entry off a low cliff onto a healthy reef wall. A ladder helps the exit.', false),
  ('bari-reef', 'Bari Reef', 'Bonaire', 'Bonaire — Kralendijk', 12.1667, -68.2817, '{shore,reef}', 'beginner', 15, 30, 26, 29, 25, 'mild', 'An easy shore dive in front of town known for an exceptional variety of reef fish.', false),
